 "issues": [
  {
   "id": "V1",
   "path": "sections.limits.0",
   "category": "facts",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "这一段称本文“只依据《清史稿·张之洞传》一部传文，未用第二种记载对照”。但 story.6 和 limits.2 都引用了同卷《王文韶传》中京汉铁路兴筑的记载，前后自相矛盾。",
   "evidence": [
    {
     "id": "QSG4371-E20",
     "quote": "而京漢鐵路亦興築於是時矣"
    }
   ],
   "proposed": "改为“本文主要依据《清史稿·张之洞传》，另引同卷《王文韶传》一条线索，未用《清史稿》以外的记载对照”。英文同步改为 relies mainly on Zhang Zhidong's biography in the Draft History of the Qing, plus one lead from the biography of Wang Wenshao in the same chapter, and has not checked it against any record outside the Draft History。"
  },
  {
   "id": "V2",
   "path": "uncertainty_note",
   "category": "facts",
